revisionDesc.change:
Separated lots of sandyakṣaras;
               commented out the adhyāyas other than 6.17 to lighten Saktumiva's collation
               load|

div.p:
tad yathā madhurāmlaḥ, madhuralavaṇaḥ, madhurakaṭukaḥ,
                       madhuratiktaḥ, madhurakaṣāyaḥ, ete pañcānukrāntā madhureṇa; amlalavaṇaḥ,
                       amlakaṭukaḥ, amlatiktaḥ, amlakaṣāyaḥ, ete catvāro 'nukrāntā amlena;
                       lavaṇakaṭukaḥ, lavaṇatiktaḥ, lavaṇakaṣāyaḥ, ete trayo 'nukrāntā lavaṇena;
                       kaṭutiktaḥ, kaṭukaṣāyaḥ, dvāv etāv anukrāntau kaṭukena; tiktakaṣāyaḥ eka
                       evānukrāntas tiktena; evam ete pañcadaśa dvikasaṃyogā vyākhyātāḥ ||
